### 1. Health check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health

### 2. Locations
GET http://localhost:8080/api/locations

### 3. Register first student (ride creator)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo Creator","studentId":"25BCE5001","email":"creator@vitstudent.ac.in","phone":"9876543210","gender":"Male","password":"demo123"}

### 4. Register second student (passenger)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Demo Passenger","studentId":"25BCE5002","email":"passenger@vitstudent.ac.in","phone":"9876543211","gender":"Female","password":"demo123"}

### 5. Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"identifier":"creator@vitstudent.ac.in","password":"demo123"}

### 6. Create a ride: VIT Chennai (1) -> Chennai Airport (2)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rides
Content-Type: application/json

{"creatorId":1,"pickupLocationId":1,"dropLocationId":2,"startDateTime":"2026-10-15T18:00:00","estimatedEndDateTime":"2026-10-15T19:00:00","cabType":"Sedan","cabProvider":"Uber","totalSeats":4,"genderPreference":"Any","estimatedFare":800,"notes":"Airport trip after classes"}

### 7. Search rides
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rides/search?pickup=VIT%20Chennai&drop=Chennai%20Airport

### 8. Passenger requests to join Ride 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/rides/1/join
Content-Type: application/json

{"userId":2}

### 9. Creator accepts Booking 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/bookings/1/accept
Content-Type: application/json

{"creatorId":1}

### 10. Check Ride 1 members
GET http://localhost:8080/api/rides/1/members
